    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>WETTOP</strong> is a thrilling parkour adventure where <strong>every step matters</strong>.<br>Climb, jump, and sprint your way through a vertical world filled with floating platforms, dangerous gaps, and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with <strong>10 shared lives</strong> \u2014 make them count.<br>One mistake can cost you, and once the lives are gone\u2026 it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls, but challenging paths.<br>Every level demands precision timing, smart movement, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face <strong>mini tasks and puzzles</strong> along the way to unlock checkpoints or gain an edge.<br>From pressure pads to leap-of-faith jumps, each challenge keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a foggy mountain landscape, WETTOP brings a mysterious, dream-like vibe.<br>Watch clouds move around you as you climb toward the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Only Up</i> but with its own heartbeat-style life system,<br>WETTOP blends tension, beauty, and parkour mechanics into a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>solo experience</strong> \u2014 no distractions, just you vs the climb.<br>Every fall feels personal, every success feels earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The glowing <strong>10-life heartbeat health bar</strong> keeps you visually connected to survival.<br>Feel your lives pulse with intensity as you progress higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go without falling?<br>Will you conquer WETTOP or run out of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd7 The climb starts now.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>WETTOP</strong> is a thrilling parkour adventure where <strong>every step matters</strong>.<br>Climb, jump, and sprint your way through a vertical world filled with floating platforms, dangerous gaps, and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with <strong>10 shared lives</strong> \u2014 make them count.<br>One mistake can cost you, and once the lives are gone\u2026 it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls, but challenging paths.<br>Every level demands precision timing, smart movement, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face <strong>mini tasks and puzzles</strong> along the way to unlock checkpoints or gain an edge.<br>From pressure pads to leap-of-faith jumps, each challenge keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a foggy mountain landscape, WETTOP brings a mysterious, dream-like vibe.<br>Watch clouds move around you as you climb toward the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Only Up</i> but with its own heartbeat-style life system,<br>WETTOP blends tension, beauty, and parkour mechanics into a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>solo experience</strong> \u2014 no distractions, just you vs the climb.<br>Every fall feels personal, every success feels earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The glowing <strong>10-life heartbeat health bar</strong> keeps you visually connected to survival.<br>Feel your lives pulse with intensity as you progress higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go without falling?<br>Will you conquer WETTOP or run out of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd7 The climb starts now.</p>",
    "short_description": "WETTOP is a challenging first-person parkour adventure where every jump counts. With only 10 lives, your goal is to climb to the top of a towering world filled with thrilling jumps, moving platforms, and surprising tasks. Miss a jump, and you fall\u2014lose a life. Lose them all? It's game over.",
